---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="Preview your checkout — The Gubbi"><header class="checkout-heading wrap"><a href="/shop" class="text-link">← Back to the objects</a><h1>Good taste.<br/><span class="serif">Almost home.</span></h1><p>This is a checkout preview. No information is sent or saved. No order or payment is taken.</p></header><section class="checkout-layout wrap" id="checkout-content"><form id="checkout-form"><h2>Your details</h2><div class="form-grid"><label>First name<input name="firstName" autocomplete="given-name" required maxlength="80"/></label><label>Last name<input name="lastName" autocomplete="family-name" required maxlength="80"/></label><label class="full-width">Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="160"/></label><label class="full-width">Street address<input name="address" autocomplete="street-address" required maxlength="250"/></label><label>City<input name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" required maxlength="80"/></label><label>PIN code<input name="postalCode" autocomplete="postal-code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" title="Enter a six-digit Indian PIN code" required maxlength="6"/></label></div><label class="gift-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" id="gift-toggle"/>This is for someone with excellent taste.</label><label id="gift-note-field" hidden>A little note for them<textarea name="giftNote" maxlength="300" rows="3" placeholder="Saw this. Thought of you." disabled></textarea></label><button class="button button--wide" type="submit" disabled>Finish the preview <Icon/></button><p class="small muted">Just a demonstration. There is no payment step.</p></form><aside class="checkout-summary"><h2>Your little haul</h2><div id="checkout-items"></div><div class="subtotal"><span>Illustrative subtotal</span><strong data-checkout-total></strong></div><div class="summary-line"><span>Shipping & taxes</span><span>To be confirmed</span></div><p class="small muted">These prices are for preview purposes only. Final prices and fulfilment details will arrive before launch.</p><button class="text-button" data-open-bag>Edit your bag</button></aside></section><section class="checkout-empty wrap" id="checkout-empty" hidden><h2>Your bag is taking a breather.</h2><p>Add an object to try the checkout preview.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Find a desk mate <Icon/></a></section><section class="checkout-success wrap" id="checkout-success" hidden tabindex="-1"><img src="/brand/gubbi-flower.svg" alt="" width="90" height="90"/><h2>That’s the <span class="serif">little journey.</span></h2><p>You’ve reached the end of the preview. No order was placed, no payment was taken, and your details haven’t been saved. Your bag is still here for another look.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Keep exploring <Icon/></a></section></Layout>
